 ("Wild", "Seeing ultraviolet", "Zebrafish have four types of cone photoreceptor, one tuned to ultraviolet light. They see colours that humans cannot."),
 ("Wild", "A short wild life", "In the wild most zebrafish probably live about a year. Protected in an aquarium they commonly reach 3-5 years."),
