 ("1984", "A sudden loss", "George Streisinger died of a heart attack in August 1984, aged 56. His colleagues in Eugene decided to carry the zebrafish project forward."),
 ("1986", "Watching neurons grow", "Judith Eisen, Paul Myers and Monte Westerfield followed single identified motor neurons as they grew in living embryos (Nature, 1986)."),
